      "evidence": [
        "The 2026-10-17 upstream inventory for Microsoft.Graph.Authentication 2.41.2, ExchangeOnlineManagement 3.10.1, Az.Storage 9.7.2, Az.Accounts 5.5.3, MicrosoftTeams 8.0.0, and Az.Resources 10.2.1 added Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Abstractions to the conflict surface and moved Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions to versions 2.2.0.0 and 10.0.0.0; Az.Accounts is now an additional contributor to both paired Microsoft.Extensions assemblies.",
        "Both Microsoft.Extensions assemblies remain classified block under #193: they are incidental transitives and are directly referenced with ExcludeAssets=runtime, so the new upstream copies remain outside DLLPickle's preload bundle. No preload classification changed.",
