        "MicrosoftTeams"
      ],
      "updateMode": "reportOnly",
      "reason": "#193: paired with DependencyInjection.Abstractions (depends on it); same incidental-transitive collision with Az modules. Excluded from the bundle (ExcludeAssets=runtime).",
      "evidence": {
        "alcOwner": "Default (collision)",
        "basis": "Excluded alongside DependencyInjection.Abstractions in 2.0.2. Microsoft.IdentityModel.Tokens still loads without it bundled (resolves lazily / supplied by the consuming service modules). The 2026-10-17 inventory confirms the same paired exclusion remains necessary as Az.Accounts now contributes version 10.0.0.0.",
        "decidedOn": "2026-05-31",
        "issue": "193",
        "trackingScope": "The refreshed inventory now observes Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Abstractions from Az.Accounts and MicrosoftTeams at versions 10.0.0.0 and 2.2.0.0. It remains excluded from the bundle as the paired dependency of Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions, which Az.Resources and Az.Accounts ship. #193 remains a DLLPickle-bundle-vs-consumer collision; preserve the regression guard against re-bundling in tests/Integration/DLLPickle.IntegrationTest.Tests.ps1 and re-adjudicate runtime behavior when upstream dependency content changes."
      },
      "targetFrameworks": [
        "net8.0",
        "net9.0",
